    "She2KCwN-text": {
      "why": "\"Students must complete a minimum of 81 units: Core | 30 units, Statistics | 3-5 units, Breadth in Discipline | 20-25 units, Depth in Discipline | 18-25 units (5-7 courses), Electives | 9 units (3 courses), Capstone | 1+ units\". A summary of the sections below; the 81 units are the program minimum and each section is its own rule.",
      "patch": {
        "info": true
      }
    },
